{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14224070","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14224070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422407001:1":{"text":"これは意外な収穫がありました。まさか衛兵に成り済ますとはね。","source_cn":"没想到还有意外收获，这帮人还真敢冒充卫兵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE3BB5F452EAB806","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422407002:1":{"text":"彫像の件が解決したら、さっそくサリエ様に報告しなければ。","source_cn":"等雕像的事解决了，得像沙利叶大人报告这件事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x365FC63C346AD193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422407003:1":{"text":"ところで閣下、そろそろ破片を渡してもらえますか？","source_cn":"阁下，你是不是得把碎块交出来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD211F1F35573F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"彫像の破片","source_cn":"雕像碎块","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9291A57BF118A83C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422407004:1":{"text":"受け取れ……もうすべては終わったのだ。","source_cn":"拿去吧……反正现在什么都完了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF668151D2C8E9F8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1422407004":{"text":"受け取れ……もうすべては終わったのだ。","source_cn":"拿去吧……反正现在什么都完了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF668151D2C8E9F8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422407005:1":{"text":"サロクディアは変わってしまった……かつては私の一言で、誰もが震え上がったものだよ。","source_cn":"……你们知道萨洛克兰变化有多大吗？以前我们说一句话，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD04E4D795E23A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422407006:1":{"text":"だが今はどうだ？下っ端の使用人にまで軽蔑の目で見られる始末だ！","source_cn":"现在呢？连最低等的仆从都敢用轻蔑的眼神看我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29ABD0A415559763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422407007:1":{"text":"地位も特権もなくなり、限られた量の霊水しか手に入らない！","source_cn":"地位没了，特权没了，连灵露都要限量供应！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0309095028D15824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422407008:1":{"text":"なぜ私ともあろうものが平民と対等の立場なんだ？私は生粋の貴族だぞ！","source_cn":"那些平民凭什么和我们平起平坐？我们可是世代的贵族啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB87B49849C58B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422407009:1":{"text":"はぁ、生粋の……？確かあなたのお父様が親戚筋から爵位を継いだことは記憶していますが……","source_cn":"哈？世代的贵族？我倒是记得您的父亲是继承了亲戚的爵位……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02236BE9A9C5342B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422407010:1":{"text":"黙れ！とにかく破片は……私に過去の美しい幻想を見せてくれる。誰もが私に敬意を払い、高みから見下ろしていた日々の……","source_cn":"哼！总之，碎块……至少能让我看到一些美好的幻象。那些人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x743F70CB583B4263","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422407011:1":{"text":"それしか頼るものがなかったんだよ……そして、もしかしたらまた……","source_cn":"而我依靠它……或许能再度……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48BC6CC24AEF9887","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422407012:1":{"text":"何とも皮肉なものですね。ただの石片が見せる幻想に、そこまで魅了されるとは……","source_cn":"真是讽刺。一块破石头的幻象就能让你这么着迷？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83C7652BC9EA3431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422407013:1":{"text":"早く目を覚ました方がいいですよ。そして今のサロクディアから目を背けないでください。","source_cn":"睁开眼看看现在的萨洛克兰吧，我劝你早点醒悟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5BAFEF66D49C8A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422407014:1":{"text":"陛下の魔法がこれほど強力とはね。人の哀れな虚栄心を、ここまで徹底的に利用できるんだから。","source_cn":"没想到女王的魔法这么厉害，连人的可怜虚荣心都能利用得这...","status":"mat